- 2026-01-26: Implemented `docket migrate` command in src/commands/migrate.rs
  - Uses working copy approach instead of `jj file write` for compatibility with older jj versions
  - Collects all change files (sharded and flat) and release files
  - Switches to state branch, writes files, then switches back
  - Removes .docket from working copy after migration
  - Added idempotency check (early return if already in state branch mode)
- 2026-01-26: Wired up command in commands/mod.rs, cli.rs, and main.rs
- 2026-01-26: Added 4 integration tests:
  - migrate_requires_jj_repo: Verifies error when not in jj repo
  - migrate_moves_changes_to_state_branch: Verifies full migration flow
  - migrate_is_idempotent: Verifies running twice is safe
  - migrate_preserves_event_history: Verifies all events are preserved
- 2026-01-26: All 151 tests pass, clippy clean
